#: tutorial.kolf:2
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Tutorial Course"
msgstr "Vodič"

#: tutorial.kolf:68
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "<h3>Welcome</h3> to the tutorial course for Kolf!"
msgstr "<h3>Dobro došli</h3> u vodič za igru Kolf!"

#: tutorial.kolf:125
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"To hit the ball, press and hold the Down Arrow or left mouse button. How "
"long you hold down the mouse button or key determines strength of the shot."
msgstr "Za udarac po loptici pritisnite i držite tipku sa strelicom prema dolje ili lijevu tipku miša. Trajanje pritiska određuje snagu udarca."

#: tutorial.kolf:182
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"To aim the putter, press the Left (rotate counterclockwise) and Right "
"(rotate clockwise) Arrow keys or use the mouse."
msgstr "Za usmjeravanje palice pritisnite strelicu ulijevo (okretanje suprotno od kazaljke na satu) ili udesno (u smjeru kazaljke na satu), odnosno koristite miš."

#: tutorial.kolf:292
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"<h3>Bridges</h3>Bridges can have walls on the top, bottom, left, or right."
msgstr "<h3>Mostovi</h3>Mostovi mogu imati zidove na vrhu, dnu, lijevoj ili desnoj strani."

#: tutorial.kolf:415
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"<h3>Everything</h3>Here's a hole that has it all. Have fun with Kolf!"
"<br><center>-- Jason Katz-Brown</center>"
msgstr "<h3>Sve</h3>Ova rupa ima sve. Zabavite se igrajući Kolf!<br><center>-- Jason Katz-Brown</center>"

#: tutorial.kolf:529
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"<h3>Slopes</h3>Slopes are slanted areas of ground that push the ball in the "
"direction that they slope. This direction is shown when you choose <u>Hole-"
">Show Info</u>."
msgstr "<h3>Padine</h3>Padine su nagnuti dijelovi terena koji guraju lopticu u smjeru nagiba. Smjer se prikazuje odabirom <u>Rupa->Prikaži informacije</u>."

#: tutorial.kolf:585
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "Hit the ball onto the slope and let it roll into cup."
msgstr "Udarite lopticu na padinu i pustite je da se otkotrlja u rupu."

#: tutorial.kolf:661
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "Try out these different types of slopes."
msgstr "Isprobajte različite vrste padina."

#: tutorial.kolf:801
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"The steepness of a slope is shown when you choose <u>Hole->Show Info</u>. "
"Steepness goes from 8 (steepest) to 1 (shallowest)."
msgstr "Strmina padine prikazuje se odabirom <u>Rupa->Prikaži informacije</u>. Vrijednost strmine kreće se od 8 (najstrmije) do 1 (najblaže)."

#: tutorial.kolf:885
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "<h3>Walls</h3>Bounce the ball off of the red walls."
msgstr "<h3>Zidovi</h3>Odbijte lopticu od crvenih zidova."

#: tutorial.kolf:995
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "<h3>Sand</h3>Sand is yellow, and slows your ball down."
msgstr "<h3>Pijesak</h3>Pijesak je žut i usporava lopticu."

#: tutorial.kolf:1051
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"<h3>Puddles (Water)</h3>Hitting into a puddle (blue) adds a penalty stroke "
"to your score, and your ball is placed outside the puddle."
msgstr "<h3>Lokve (voda)</h3>Udarac u lokvu (plavu) dodaje kazneni udarac rezultatu, a loptica se postavlja izvan lokve."

#: tutorial.kolf:1123
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"<h3>Windmills</h3>Windmills (brown base with moving arm) have brown walls "
"(or half walls). The speed of the windmill arm may vary for each hole."
msgstr "<h3>Vjetrenjače</h3>Vjetrenjače (smeđe postolje s pomičnom rukom) imaju smeđe zidove ili poluzidove. Brzina ruke može se razlikovati za svaku rupu."

#: tutorial.kolf:1207
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"<h3>Black Holes</h3>Black Holes transport the ball to their exit, and eject "
"it at a speed in direct relation to the speed your ball was traveling. "
"Choose <u>Hole->Show Info</u> to see which Black Hole goes to which exit and "
"the direction the ball will come out."
msgstr "<h3>Crne rupe</h3>Crne rupe prenose lopticu do izlaza i izbacuju je brzinom izravno ovisnom o brzini kojom se kretala. Odaberite <u>Rupa->Prikaži informacije</u> da biste vidjeli koja je crna rupa povezana s kojim izlazom i u kojem će smjeru loptica izaći."

#: tutorial.kolf:1294
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"<h3>Floaters</h3>Floaters are moving platforms that carry a ball that lands "
"on it. Floaters' speeds vary."
msgstr "<h3>Pokretne platforme</h3>Pokretne platforme prenose lopticu koja na njih sleti. Njihova se brzina razlikuje."
